#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/nearneighbor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.nearneighbor.nearneighbor:195
msgid ""
"For geographic data (**x**\\|\\ **y**\\|\\ **d**), valid units are **d**, "
"**m**, **s**, **e**, **f**, **k**, **M**, and **n** [Default is **e**]. See :"
"ref:`distance-units` for meanings of the units."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/nearneighbor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.nearneighbor.nearneighbor:198
msgid ""
"For projected data (**X**\\|\\ **Y**\\|\\ **D**), valid units are **c**, "
"**i**, and **p**. See :ref:`dimension-units` for meanings of the units."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/nearneighbor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.nearneighbor.nearneighbor:201
msgid ""
"Append modifier **+a** to specify that *all* the criteria must be met "
"[default imposes breaks if any one criterion is met]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/nearneighbor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.nearneighbor.nearneighbor:204
msgid "One of the following modifiers can be appended:"
